[6343]="7003E59D\n1\tTalk to Anhebir\tAnhebir is in Rivendell, far to the east of Thorenhad. Elrohir asked you to bring word of the gaunt-man to his father, Elrond, instructing you to speak with the marchwarden, Anhebir, for directions to the Last Homely House.\n2\tTalk to Elrond\tMaster Elrond is in his library in the Last Homely House, north and north-east from Anhebir's post. Anhebir gave instructions on how to find the Last Homely House. You should hurry to bring Master Elrond Elrohir's message.\n",
