[6359]="700561DB\n1\tTalk to Burginda\tBurginda can be found at Edoras or the Kingstead neighbourhoods. You should talk to Burginda.\n",
[6360]="7006EC21\n1\tMake the beds (total: 4)\030Scrub the floors (total: 4)\tDarôma has offered to pay you to make the beds and clean the floors in the guest rooms of The Cracked Flagon.\n2\tTalk to Darôma\tYou have made the beds and scrubbed the floors of the guest rooms of The Cracked Flagon. You should return to Darôma inside the inn to collect your reward.\n",
[6361]="700555A6\n1\tDestroy ritual tomes (total: 8)\tRitual tomes can be found in Bâr Nírnaeth, the Houses of Lamentation. You should destroy the ritual tomes.\n2\tCompleted\tDestroyed ritual tomes within Bâr Nírnaeth.\n",
[6362]="700555A5\n1\tDestroy roots of Morloth (total: 8)\tRoots of Morloth can be found in Bâr Nírnaeth, the Houses of Lamentation. You should destroy the far reaching roots.\n2\tCompleted\tDestroyed roots of Morloth within Bâr Nírnaeth.\n",
[6363]="700555A7\n1\tDestroy blood reserves (total: 8)\tBlood reserves can be found in Bâr Nírnaeth, the Houses of Lamentation. You should destroy the blood reserves.\n2\tCompleted\tDestroyed blood reserves within Bâr Nírnaeth.\n",
[6364]="700261E1\n1\tSpeak with Maengamiel in the Festival Garden\tThe Elf Maengamiel can be found in the Garden of Duillond, watching helplessly over the shrew-ridden field. You should tell Maengamiel about Bodo Burrows' proposition.\n2\tSpeak with Nibs Cotton at the Cotton Farm in Bywater\030Speak with Wald Sandson at Sandson's Farm\030Speak with the Gaffer in Hobbiton\tNibs Cotton is at the Cotton's farm in Bywater, while Wald Sandson is at Sandson's Farm near Michel Delving. The Gaffer Hamfast Gamgee is in Hobbiton, of course. You should speak with the gardeners of the Shire to learn about how hobbits deal with shrews.\n3\tSpeak with Maengamiel in the Festival Garden\tMaengamiel is in the Festival Garden in Duillond, watching over the shrew chaos. You should tell Maengamiel what you learned from the three hobbit gardeners.\n",
[6365]="7005857D\n1\tDefeat Wargs at Howlers' Notch (total: 12)\tHowlers' Notch can be found in central Elderslade. You should defeat Wargs at Howlers' Notch.\n2\tDefeat the den mother\tThe den mother can be found inside the cave at Howler's Notch. Defeat the den mother.\n3\tReturn to Gunvald\tGunvald is in Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade. Return to Gunvald.\n",
[6366]="70058743\n1\tBreak chains\tChains can be found at Howlers' Notch. You should break chains that you find at Howlers' Notch.\n2\tBreak chains (total: 8)\tChains can be found at Howlers' Notch. You should break chains that you find at Howlers' Notch.\n3\tCompleted\tBroke many chains at Howlers' Notch.\n",
[6367]="70058747\n1\tBurn slop piles\tSlop piles can be found scattered around Howlers' Notch. You should burn any slop piles that you find.\n2\tBurn slop piles (total: 12)\tSlop piles can be found scattered around Howlers' Notch. You should burn any slop piles that you find.\n3\tCompleted\tBurned many slop piles at Howlers' Notch.\n",
[6368]="7004DA22\n1\tDefeat wolves in Eryn Lasgalen and the Dale-lands (total: 10)\tWolves can be found in Eryn Lasgalen and the Dale-lands. You should defeat wolves in Eryn Lasgalen and the Dale-lands.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many wolves in Eryn Lasgalen and the Dale-lands.\n",
